:''For the enemy encountered in the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]], see [[Sairi Nijitani (Enemy)]].''
'''Sairi Nijitani''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and is exclusive to the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. It is acquired after beating the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event#Date Chance: Sairi|Date Chance: Sairi Stages]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 386
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Sairi Nijitani
|name2 = Sairi Nijitani CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sairi Nijitani CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
While her 50% [[Weaken|weaken]] effect is solid, she has a very long recharge time with Single Target. Like [[Stilts Cat (Rare Cat)|Stilts Cat]], she is only useful for fighting single bosses that have low range like [[Boraphim]] and [[Angelic Gory]]. However, since many Angels have high enough attack power to render the weaken effect negligible, Sairi is rarely helpful, and can be replaced by [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] once he is [[Talents|Talented]].

Notably, she has Single Target in all forms, which renders her useless against hordes of enemies.

{{Job|Classification=Crowd-Controller}}

